{#- The scene's current location body. A `secrecy: secret` location carries the
    same heading world info gives a secret entry — the party is standing in the
    room, but that does not mean every character in it knows what the room is.
    A `gm-only` location never gets here at all: `_assemble` leaves
    `current_setting` empty for one (#49).
    Vars: current_setting (str — the location entity's body, stripped; "" when
    the scene has no location), current_setting_secret (bool). -#}
{%- from "scene/_secrecy.j2" import secret_block -%}
{%- if current_setting %}# Current setting
{{ secret_block([current_setting]) if current_setting_secret else current_setting }}{% endif -%}
